    "note": "imperial width-unit dropdown option next to the metric option 'm', read next to a numeric takeoff measurement. Not an invariant SI-style symbol: most locales translate it as a real unit-name label (es/es-CL/es-CO: ft + pulg, fr: pi + po, ru: фт + дюйм, kk/ky/uk: фут + дюйм, ja: フィート + インチ, zh: 英尺 + 英寸), which shows the listed locales still carry the plain English copy."
  },
